## Interface: 16001, 11508, 11507
## Title: Companion Beacon
## Notes: Shows your position, level, XP, party and quest log as a small block of coloured squares in the bottom-right corner, for the WoW Companion to read off the screen. Also switches the combat and chat logs on at login. /cbeacon hides or shows it.
## Author: WoW Companion
## Version: 7

CompanionBeacon.lua
